sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Tech as Lab Technician
    participant System as Smart Hospital System (SHMS)

    Tech->>System: fetchPendingTestOrders()
    activate System
    System-->>Tech: displayTestOrderQueue(orderList)
    deactivate System

    Tech->>System: logSampleCollection(orderId, sampleType)
    activate System
    System-->>Tech: sampleLoggedBarcodeGenerated(sampleId, status="SampleCollected")
    deactivate System

    Tech->>System: submitTestResultsAndReport(orderId, resultValues, pdfReport)
    activate System
    System->>System: verifyReferenceRanges()
    System->>System: updateStatusToApproved()
    System-->>Tech: labReportPublished(reportId, status="Approved")
    deactivate System
